'''Red Wind''' (風 (赤) ''Kaze (Aka)'', '''Wind (Red)''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

