|name = Red Wind
|image = E 581.png
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
|appearance = [[JRA Collaboration Event]]<br>
[[Heartbeat Catcademy#List of Stages|Weekend: Confession]]<br>
[[Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering]]
}}

==Enemy==
Red Wind has pathetically low stats and is nearly identical to [[White Wind]], with the minor difference of having the weaken ability instead of knockback and having the Red trait. Just like Wind though, he's almost always fought in stages with heavy unit restrictions.

==Strategy==
Somehow Red Wind is even more of a pushover than the original, as most of the time his weaken ability will just affect either [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]] or [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]], neither of which do much damage anyways.

